        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Walking Peacemaker",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112947986455",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 28595162-719b-4659-b42d-e90d1a387c65).Image",
        "Description": "Over the past year there have been sightings of an armed group in Santa Fortuna. They&apos;re not ours, of course. Santa Fortuna doesn&apos;t have an army, as stated by article 12 of our constitution. The authorities claim it&apos;s a multinational security firm hired by the development corporation of Santa Fortuna. Lies, obviously. I understand that you and your men have neither state nor ideology - that you will fight any foe. Please, you must drive them out of our defenseless country.",
